// ============================================================================
// OmniScript Stage-1 Self-Hosted Compiler (`bootstrap/omnic_stage1.omni`)
// 100% Deterministic OmniScript -> compiles `.omni` source directly to `OBC1`
// Capable of compiling ITSELF (Stage-1 -> Stage-2 -> Stage-3 fixpoint)!
// ============================================================================

